# Title: Suspicious Workstation Locking via Rundll32
# ID: 3b5b0213-0460-4e3f-8937-3abf98ff7dcc
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-06-04
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects a suspicious call to the user32.dll function that locks the user workstation
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((CommandLine="*user32.dll,*") AND ((Image="*\\rundll32.exe") OR (OriginalFileName="RUNDLL32.EXE")) AND (ParentImage="*\\cmd.exe") AND (CommandLine="*LockWorkStation*"))
